      "side": 1,
      "message": "One thing I\u0027m trying to keep in mind as we make these edits is what is relevant to a large cross section of Gerrit operators. For me at least knowing that an online reindex on upgrade is possible is important. As is knowing that a downgrade is possible. I will test both in our test environment before we proceed with any upgrade. Details like checking results of reindexing and knowing that you only need to reindex on a downgrade if changes were modified/pushed to during the time after upgrade and before downgrade are probably less important.\n\nEssentially I want to know what the happy paths are and that there is an outlet if the worst happens. Then I can sort out the details via CI and our test environment. But without knowing that these happy paths exist and that there is a downgrade path I\u0027m left questioning if the fact they work in our CI system or in test envs is a fluke or intended. Communicating the big picture these things are intended is my main motivation with this change.",
