      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are we thinking something like:\n\n```\n#### Upgrade from Gerrit v3.13 to v3.14\n\n##### Upgrade with an online reindex\n\n- Stop Gerrit\n- Download the new `gerrit.war` and move it to `$GERRIT_SITE/bin`\n- Extract all the plugins from `gerrit.war` and move the ones needed into `$GERRIT_SITE/plugins`\n- Start Gerrit\n- Confirm online reindexing of the Changes index from version v87 to v88 completes via the Gerrit error_log\n\n##### Upgrade with an offline reindex\n\n- Stop Gerrit\n- Download the new `gerrit.war` and move it to `$GERRIT_SITE/bin`\n- Extract all the plugins from `gerrit.war` and move the ones needed into `$GERRIT_SITE/plugins`\n- Run the full reindex:\n  `java -jar $GERRIT_SITE/bin/gerrit.war reindex --index changes -d $GERRIT_SITE`\n- Check the reindex results for successful completion\n- Start Gerrit\n```",
